materials.text:
請以這份完整HTML為既有需求與設計基礎重新輸出單檔網站。只優化CSS的可閱讀性：桌機完整卡片留白，手機表格逐筆卡片閱讀；保留全部可見文字、價格、id、class、JavaScript與功能。不要新增照片、履歷、評價、營業資訊。
請只回一個完整可執行HTML程式碼區塊；不要省略任何程式碼，不要另加說明。最小字級桌機16px，手機內文18px、按鈕16px、區標32px。
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>示範顧問｜顧問預約與付款流程原型</title>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#f4f2ed;
  --paper:#fffdf9;
  --ink:#1f2825;
  --muted:#59645f;
  --line:#d9ddd8;
  --brand:#1f5b4d;
  --brand2:#e2eee8;
  --warm:#f2e7d7;
  --danger:#a33b32;
  --danger-bg:#f9e8e5;
  --ok:#226d50;
  --ok-bg:#e2f1e9;
  --warn:#875d20;
  --warn-bg:#f8eed8;
  --radius:22px;
  --shadow:0 16px 45px rgba(31,40,37,.07);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
  margin:0;
  background:var(--bg);
  color:var(--ink);
  font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI","PingFang TC","Noto Sans TC",sans-serif;
  font-size:18px;
  line-height:1.7;
}
button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit}
button,a{touch-action:manipulation}
a{color:inherit}
.container{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 48px));margin:auto}
.notice{
  background:#173e35;
  color:#fff;
  text-align:center;
  padding:13px 20px;
  font-size:16px;
  font-weight:700;
  letter-spacing:.02em;
}
nav{
  position:sticky;
  top:0;
  z-index:20;
  background:rgba(255,253,249,.94);
  backdrop-filter:blur(15px);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
}
.nav-inner{
  min-height:74px;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:space-between;
  gap:24px;
}
.brand{font-size:21px;font-weight:850;white-space:nowrap}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:25px;align-items:center}
.nav-links a{text-decoration:none;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}
.btn{
  border:0;
  border-radius:999px;
  padding:13px 22px;
  min-height:50px;
  font-size:16px;
  font-weight:800;
  cursor:pointer;
  display:inline-flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  gap:8px;
  text-decoration:none;
}
.btn-primary{background:var(--brand);color:#fff}
.btn-secondary{background:var(--brand2);color:var(--brand)}
.btn-ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink)}
.btn-danger{background:var(--danger-bg);color:var(--danger)}
.hero{
  padding:104px 0 88px;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 88% 10%,#dfece6 0,transparent 31%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 3% 65%,#f0dfca 0,transparent 27%),
    var(--paper);
}
.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:60px;align-items:center}
.eyebrow{
  display:inline-flex;
  padding:8px 13px;
  border-radius:999px;
  background:var(--brand2);
  color:var(--brand);
  font-size:16px;
  font-weight:850;
}
h1{
  max-width:780px;
  margin:20px 0;
  font-size:clamp(48px,6vw,78px);
  line-height:1.08;
  letter-spacing:-.045em;
}
.hero p{max-width:720px;font-size:21px;color:var(--muted)}
.hero-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:30px}
.hero-card,.card,.panel{
  background:var(--paper);
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:var(--radius);
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}
.hero-card{padding:30px}
.hero-card strong{display:block;font-size:25px;margin-bottom:10px}
.checklist{padding:0;margin:20px 0 0;list-style:none}
.checklist li{padding:11px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.checklist li:before{content:"✓";color:var(--brand);font-weight:900;margin-right:10px}
section{padding:86px 0}
.section-head{max-width:800px;margin-bottom:38px}
.section-head h2{font-size:42px;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 13px;letter-spacing:-.025em}
.section-head p{color:var(--muted);margin:0}
.grid-2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:22px}
.grid-3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px}
.card{padding:28px}
.card h3{font-size:25px;margin:0 0 10px}
.card p{color:var(--muted)}
.tag{
  display:inline-flex;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:999px;
  padding:5px 11px;
  font-size:16px;
  font-weight:750;
}
.price{font-size:38px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.2;margin:18px 0 4px}
.package-card{position:relative}
.package-card.selected{outline:3px solid var(--brand);outline-offset:2px}
.package-card button{margin-top:15px;width:100%}
.list{padding-left:22px}
.list li{margin:8px 0}
.exclude{background:#f6f3ee;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:14px;margin-top:20px}
.alt{background:#e8ece8}
.proof{
  border-left:4px solid var(--brand);
  padding-left:17px;
  color:var(--ink)!important;
  font-weight:700;
}
.form-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .8fr;gap:24px;align-items:start}
.panel{padding:30px}
.field{margin-bottom:22px}
label{display:block;font-weight:850;margin-bottom:8px}
input,select,textarea{
  width:100%;
  background:#fff;
  color:var(--ink);
  border:1px solid #bcc6c1;
  border-radius:13px;
  padding:14px 15px;
  min-height:54px;
  font-size:18px;
}
textarea{min-height:130px;resize:vertical}
.help{font-size:16px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:7px}
.summary-row{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  gap:20px;
  padding:12px 0;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
}
.summary-row span:last-child{text-align:right;font-weight:750}
.summary-row.total{font-size:23px;border-bottom:0;padding-top:19px}
.confirm-box{
  margin:23px 0;
  padding:18px;
  border-radius:15px;
  background:var(--warm);
}
.status-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:14px}
.status-card{
  min-height:150px;
  padding:20px;
  background:var(--paper);
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:18px;
}
.status-card.active{outline:3px solid var(--brand)}
.status-card strong{display:block;font-size:19px;margin-bottom:8px}
.dot{
  width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;
  display:inline-block;background:#9aa29e;margin-right:7px
}
.active .dot{background:var(--brand)}
.state-box{
  margin-top:25px;
  border-radius:20px;
  padding:25px;
  background:var(--paper);
  border:1px solid var(--line);
}
.state-box.success{background:var(--ok-bg);border-color:#9bc6b2}
.state-box.failed{background:var(--danger-bg);border-color:#dfaaa4}
.state-box.cancelled{background:var(--warn-bg);border-color:#dec38e}
.delivery{display:none;margin-top:25px}
.delivery.show{display:block}
.table-wrap{overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;background:#fff}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:800px}
th,td{text-align:left;padding:16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:16px;vertical-align:top}
th{background:#edf0ed;font-weight:850}
.schema{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:16px}
.code-id{color:var(--brand);font-weight:850}
.flow{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
  gap:12px;
}
.flow-step{
  background:#fff;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  padding:18px;
  border-radius:17px;
}
.flow-step b{display:block;margin-bottom:6px}
.callout{
  padding:21px 23px;
  border-radius:18px;
  background:#173e35;
  color:#fff;
}
.callout strong{font-size:22px}
.footer{padding:48px 0 70px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper)}
.footer-grid{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px}
.small{font-size:16px;color:var(--muted)}
dialog{
  width:min(650px,calc(100% - 32px));
  border:0;
  border-radius:25px;
  padding:0;
  box-shadow:0 25px 90px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
}
dialog::backdrop{background:rgba(17,24,22,.62)}
.modal-head{padding:24px 28px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}
.modal-body{padding:28px}
.modal-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:25px}
.x{
  border:0;background:#eee;border-radius:50%;
  width:42px;height:42px;cursor:pointer;font-size:20px
}
.mock-payment{
  border:1px dashed #9aa8a1;
  padding:22px;border-radius:17px;background:#f6f8f6
}
.toast{
  position:fixed;
  right:22px;
  bottom:22px;
  z-index:80;
  background:#17211e;color:white;
  padding:14px 19px;
  border-radius:13px;
  display:none;
  font-size:16px;
}
.toast.show{display:block}
@media(max-width:900px){
  .nav-links{display:none}
  .hero{padding:70px 0}
  .hero-grid,.form-layout,.grid-3{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .grid-2{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .status-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .flow{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
}
@media(max-width:600px){
  body{font-size:18px}
  .container{width:min(100% - 28px,1180px)}
  .notice,.small,.help,.tag,.btn,th,td,.schema{font-size:16px}
  .section-head h2{font-size:32px}
  section{padding:65px 0}
  h1{font-size:44px}
  .hero p{font-size:19px}
  .hero-card,.card,.panel{padding:22px}
  .flow{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .footer-grid{display:block}
  .summary-row{flex-direction:column;gap:3px}
  .summary-row span:last-child{text-align:left}
}

.site-header{position:relative!important}
/* 窄螢幕上的表格保留完整欄位，逐筆閱讀。 */
@media(max-width:640px){
 table{min-width:0!important;width:100%!important} thead{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip-path:inset(50%)}
 tbody{display:block} tr{display:block;border:1px solid var(--line,#d4cec1);border-radius:16px;margin:0 0 18px;padding:16px;background:var(--surface,#fffdf8)}
 td{display:block!important;min-width:0!important;width:auto!important;border:0!important;padding:7px 0!important;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:18px!important}
 td[data-label]:before{content:attr(data-label);display:block;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted,#626b66)}
 .table-wrap,.table-scroll{overflow:visible!important} .site-header,header{position:relative!important}
}

.starter{padding:56px 0;background:#e7ebe3}.starter-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.15fr;gap:32px;align-items:stretch}.starter-form,.starter-preview{padding:32px;border-radius:24px;background:#fffdf8;border:1px solid #c8d0c8}.starter-form{display:grid;gap:18px}.starter-form label{display:grid;gap:8px}.starter-preview{background:#17483c;color:white;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}.starter-preview h3{font-size:40px;line-height:1.25;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.starter-preview p{font-size:20px;color:#f1eee3;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.starter-preview small{font-size:16px;color:#d7ddd6}.starter-preview hr{width:100%;border:0;border-top:1px solid #668276;margin:18px 0}.starter input{width:100%;min-width:0;font-size:18px;padding:12px;border:1px solid #9dac9e;border-radius:10px}.starter h2{font-size:40px}.starter label{font-size:18px}@media(max-width:640px){.starter-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.starter h2{font-size:32px}.starter-form,.starter-preview{padding:24px}.starter-preview h3{font-size:32px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="notice">
  教學虛構示例｜本頁是金流流程原型，尚未真正串接藍新、綠界或其他金流服務
</div>

<nav>
  <div class="container nav-inner">
    <div class="brand">示範顧問 · 預約原型</div>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#plans">服務方案</a>
      <a href="#evidence">案例與文章</a>
      <a href="#booking">預約</a>
      <a href="#flow">付款流程</a>
      <a href="#environment">環境差異</a>
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#booking">預約諮詢</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">教學虛構示例 · 顧問預約與付款網站</span>
      <h1>先把問題說清楚，再決定是否值得一起解。</h1>
      <p>
        示範顧問協助團隊釐清數位服務流程、網站需求與執行優先順序。
        本原型重點不是承諾成果，而是讓客戶在付款前清楚知道方案、價格、預約時間、交付內容與退款邊界。
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#booking">預約諮詢</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#plans">先看方案</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-card">
      <strong>比較適合這些情況</strong>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>需求很多，但不知道先處理哪一件</li>
        <li>準備製作網站、系統或數位服務</li>
        <li>希望先取得可執行的決策與下一步</li>
        <li>願意提供必要背景資料，接受明確服務邊界</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="small">不保證營收、流量、募資或其他第三方可控制之外的結果。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
<section id="plans">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>服務方案</h2>
      <p>以下方案與顧問資訊皆為教學虛構示例。價格採含稅總額顯示，付款前仍會再次確認摘要。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-2">
      <article class="card package-card selected" data-plan-card="strategy">
        <span class="tag">方案 A</span>
        <h3>問題釐清諮詢</h3>
        <div class="price">NT$ 3,150</div>
        <p>60 分鐘 · 未稅 NT$ 3,000 + 稅額 NT$ 150</p>
        <strong>交付物</strong>
        <ul class="list">
          <li>60 分鐘線上諮詢</li>
          <li>問題與優先順序摘要</li>
          <li>會後一頁行動建議</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="exclude">
          <strong>不包含</strong><br>
          網站實作、廣告代操、長期專案管理、法律／財稅意見、保證特定商業成果。
        </div>
        <button class="btn btn-secondary choose-plan" data-plan="strategy">選擇此方案</button>
      </article>

      <article class="card package-card" data-plan-card="workshop">
        <span class="tag">方案 B</span>
        <h3>流程診斷工作坊</h3>
        <div class="price">NT$ 8,400</div>
        <p>120 分鐘 · 未稅 NT$ 8,000 + 稅額 NT$ 400</p>
        <strong>交付物</strong>
        <ul class="list">
          <li>120 分鐘線上工作坊</li>
          <li>現況流程與主要風險整理</li>
          <li>會後兩頁執行優先順序</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="exclude">
          <strong>不包含</strong><br>
          程式開發、正式 UI 設計稿、第三方系統採購、無限次修改、保證營收或轉換率。
        </div>
        <button class="btn btn-secondary choose-plan" data-plan="workshop">選擇此方案</button>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="alt" id="evidence">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>案例、文章與可驗證成果</h2>
      <p>本區不捏造真人客戶、評論或學員成績，只示範顧問服務如何以文件與流程作為可信證據。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-3">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="tag">教學虛構案例</span>
        <h3>預約流程重新整理</h3>
        <p>情境：團隊的詢問、報價、排程與付款分散在不同訊息管道。</p>
        <p class="proof">可驗證成果：交付一份現況流程圖、一份風險清單與明確的下一步排序。</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <span class="tag">方法論文章示例</span>
        <h3>先定義「付款成功」</h3>
        <p>瀏覽器跳回成功頁，不應直接等同後端已確認收款。正式服務需依金流通知與後端驗證結果更新訂單。</p>
        <p class="proof">驗證方式：訂單狀態與金流交易紀錄可以被獨立查詢。</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <span class="tag">方法論文章示例</span>
        <h3>交付邊界寫在付款以前</h3>
        <p>把會議時長、交付物、不包含項目、退款條件與後續追蹤先列清楚，減少雙方對服務範圍的不同理解。</p>
        <p class="proof">驗證方式：付款前摘要與完成後交付紀錄使用同一筆預約 ID。</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="booking">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>預約與付款前確認</h2>
      <p>本表單只把資料保存在你的瀏覽器 localStorage，屬於教學測試資料，不代表資料已送到真實後端。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="form-layout">
      <form class="panel" id="bookingForm">
        <div class="field">
          <label for="companyType">公司類型</label>
          <select id="companyType" required>
            <option value="個人／自由工作者">個人／自由工作者</option>
            <option value="小型團隊">小型團隊</option>
            <option value="中小企業">中小企業</option>
            <option value="非營利／教育組織">非營利／教育組織</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="problem">目前最想釐清的問題</label>
          <textarea id="problem" required>希望整理現有網站與預約付款流程，確認應該先改哪些環節。</textarea>
          <div class="help">請避免填入信用卡號、密碼、API 金鑰或其他敏感憑證。</div>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="budget">預算範圍</label>
          <select id="budget" required>
            <option>NT$ 3,000–10,000</option>
            <option>NT$ 10,001–30,000</option>
            <option>NT$ 30,001–100,000</option>
            <option>尚未確定</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="slot">可預約時段</label>
          <select id="slot" required>
            <option>2026/10/08 10:00</option>
            <option>2026/10/08 14:00</option>
            <option>2026/10/09 10:00</option>
            <option>2026/10/09 15:30</option>
          </select>
          <div class="help">以上時段為教學虛構示例，沒有連接真實行事曆。</div>
        </div>

        <button class="btn btn-secondary" type="submit">儲存教學預約資料</button>
      </form>

      <aside class="panel" id="orderPanel">
        <span class="tag">付款前確認摘要</span>
        <h3>訂單摘要</h3>

        <div class="summary-row"><span>訂單 ID</span><span id="orderId"></span></div>
        <div class="summary-row"><span>方案</span><span id="sumPlan"></span></div>
        <div class="summary-row"><span>未稅金額</span><span id="sumAmount"></span></div>
        <div class="summary-row"><span>稅額</span><span id="sumTax"></span></div>
        <div class="summary-row total"><span>含稅總額</span><span id="sumTotal"></span></div>
        <div class="summary-row"><span>預約時間</span><span id="sumSlot"></span></div>

        <div class="confirm-box">
          <strong>退款條件｜教學虛構示例</strong><br>
